      "contextFingerprint": "a1d9cbde2ee6ca505dd63c40ea6ffa809727c4af4aa4ccfb1fc06309527af9b5",
      "sourceText": "1. **函数参数优先用 `std::span<const T>`**：代替 `const vector<T>&`，更通用。\n2. **span 只是视图**：不拥有数据，必须确保底层数据存活。\n3. **子视图零拷贝**：`subspan` 等操作非常高效。\n4. **C++20 才有 span**：如果你的项目用 C++17，可以用 `std::string_view`（字符串版的 span）或第三方库。\n5. **只读参数优先 `span<const T>`**：这样 vector、array、C 数组都能传，而且不会被函数修改。",
      "translatedText": "1. **Prefer using `std::span<const T>`** for function parameters instead of `const vector<T>&`; it is more general\\.\n2. **span is only a view**：it does not own the data, so you must ensure the underlying data remains alive\\.\n3. **Subview zero\\-copy**：`subspan` and similar operations are very efficient\\.\n4. **C++20 only has span**：if your project uses C++17, you can use `std::string_view` (a string version of span) or a third\\-party library\\.\n5. **Prefer read\\-only parameters `span<const T>`**：this way vector, array, and C arrays can all be passed, and the function will not modify them\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
