    "1db5214799440a21be3e4a52ee32804bf1539eca33d3f10eb847f8db8d85c543": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "6e4872c2a7ea760b422c35f1ff76495008816b78a2cfe6b639da79b5ae5831a0",
      "contextFingerprint": "9d4513f3aa9963aed8070c4f9486f45b98da0e9ce7962658a7ca458e879c1907",
      "sourceText": "1.  **静态存储区（全局区）** ：可以分为rodata区data区和bss区，已经初始化的只读常量被放在rodata,已经被初始化的非零变量被放在data区;没有被初始化的或者值为零的变量被放在bss区，通常默认初始化为 0(表示数字的数据类型)，'\\\\0'(char类型) 和 NULL(指针类型)。\n\n2.  **栈区（stack）** ：局部变量被存放在该区，如果不初始化局部变量，那么局部变量是随机值。容量很小。\n\n3.  **堆区（heap）** ：由程序员开辟内存空间给变量，由程序员分配和释放，如果程序员不进行释放内存，则会内存泄漏，当程序结束后，系统会帮忙释放没有被释放的内存。\n\n4.  **代码区** ：存放 CPU 执行的机器指令，通常是只读的。",
      "translatedText": "1.  **Static storage area (global area)** : It can be divided into the rodata area, the data area, and the bss area\\. Initialized read\\-only constants are placed in rodata, and initialized non\\-zero variables are placed in the data area; variables that are not initialized or whose value is zero are placed in the bss area and are usually initialized by default to 0 (for numeric data types), '\\\\0' (char type), and NULL (pointer type)\\.\n\n2.  **Stack area (stack)** : Local variables are stored in this area\\. If local variables are not initialized, then the local variables contain random values\\. The capacity is very small\\.\n\n3.  **Heap area (heap)** : Memory space is allocated to variables by the programmer and is allocated and freed by the programmer\\. If the programmer does not free the memory, a memory leak will occur\\. When the program ends, the system will help free memory that has not been freed\\.\n\n4.  **Code area** : Stores the machine instructions executed by the CPU and is usually read\\-only\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 302,
        "outputTokens": 218,
        "costUsd": 0.000353
      }
